segments.text:
Observer: Capt.-Av. Alfredo Martins Filho;
          Observation Location: Anápolis SCOAM courtyard;
          Observed Object: Bright object in the southeastern sector of the aerodrome.
          Approximately 20 degrees above the horizon;
          Observation: Takeoff of F-103 with a right turn and ascent to the object's level, which disappeared as the aircraft approached;
          Approximate Time: 3:00 p.m. local time;
          Observation made with the naked eye.
